flowchart TD
    A[Network Data Arrival] --> B{Message Type?}

    B -->|CopyData - WAL| C[XLogWalRcvProcessMsg]
    B -->|CopyData - Keepalive| D[Process Keepalive]
    B -->|CopyDone| E[End Streaming]
    B -->|Error/EOF| F[Connection Error]

    C --> G{WAL Data Validation}
    G -->|Valid| H[Update receivedUpto]
    G -->|Invalid| I[Protocol Error]

    H --> J[XLogWalRcvWrite]
    J --> K{Write to Disk}
    K -->|Success| L[Update LogstreamResult.Write]
    K -->|Failure| M[Write Error]

    L --> N[XLogWalRcvFlush]
    N --> O{fsync Operation}
    O -->|Success| P[Update LogstreamResult.Flush]
    O -->|Failure| Q[Flush Error]

    P --> R[Update WalRcvData Shared Memory]
    R --> S[Signal Startup Process]

    S --> T{Reply Needed?}
    T -->|Yes - Status Interval| U[XLogWalRcvSendReply]
    T -->|Yes - HS Feedback| V[XLogWalRcvSendHSFeedback]
    T -->|No| W[Continue Processing]

    U --> X[Construct 'r' Message]
    X --> Y[Send Status Reply]
    Y --> W

    V --> Z[Get Replication Horizons]
    Z --> AA[Construct 'h' Message]
    AA --> BB[Send HS Feedback]
    BB --> W

    D --> CC[Update Keepalive Timestamp]
    CC --> DD{Reply Requested?}
    DD -->|Yes| UU[Force Reply Send]
    DD -->|No| W
    UU --> U

    W --> EE{More Data Available?}
    EE -->|Yes| A
    EE -->|No| FF[WaitLatchOrSocket]
    FF --> A

    %% Error Handling Paths
    I --> GG[Log Protocol Violation]
    GG --> HH[Attempt Recovery]
    HH --> II{Recoverable?}
    II -->|Yes| A
    II -->|No| F

    M --> JJ[Log Write Error]
    JJ --> KK[Retry Write]
    KK --> LL{Retry Success?}
    LL -->|Yes| L
    LL -->|No| F

    Q --> MM[Log Flush Error]
    MM --> NN[Retry Flush]
    NN --> OO{Retry Success?}
    OO -->|Yes| P
    OO -->|No| F

    F --> PP[WalRcvDie]
    E --> QQ[Clean Shutdown]

    %% Memory Management
    R --> RR{Memory Pressure?}
    RR -->|High| SS[Request Checkpoint]
    RR -->|Normal| W
    SS --> W

    %% Timeline Management
    C --> TT{Timeline Change?}
    TT -->|Yes| UUU[Process Timeline Switch]
    TT -->|No| G
    UUU --> VV[Fetch Timeline History]
    VV --> WW[Validate Timeline]
    WW --> XX{Valid Timeline?}
    XX -->|Yes| H
    XX -->|No| I

    %% Performance Monitoring
    P --> YY[Update Statistics]
    YY --> ZZ[LagTrackerWrite]
    ZZ --> W

    %% Buffer Management
    J --> AAA{WAL Segment Boundary?}
    AAA -->|Yes| BBB[XLogWalRcvClose]
    AAA -->|No| K
    BBB --> CCC[Open New Segment]
    CCC --> K

    %% Connection Management
    FF --> DDD{Connection Alive?}
    DDD -->|No| F
    DDD -->|Yes| A

    %% Styling
    classDef errorState fill:#ffcccc,stroke:#ff0000,stroke-width:2px
    classDef normalOp fill:#ccffcc,stroke:#00aa00,stroke-width:2px
    classDef decision fill:#ffffcc,stroke:#aaaa00,stroke-width:2px
    classDef networkOp fill:#ccccff,stroke:#0000aa,stroke-width:2px

    class F,I,M,Q,PP errorState
    class H,L,P,R,S,W normalOp
    class B,G,K,O,T,EE,RR,TT,XX,AAA,DDD decision
    class A,U,V,Y,BB networkOp